This chapter aims at introducing Public Service regulations that govern officers in the execution of the functions of a public office. Public Service operations are governed by various policies, regulations, work procedures and guidelines. These provisions mould and define the Public Service, and all employees are bound by them. The regulations cover human resource management and development and staff welfare matters.

